sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Payroll operator
    participant ENG as Payroll engine - return composer
    participant LED as Establishment ECR ledger
    participant EPFO as EPFO portal - attended session
    actor APP as Named approver
    actor PAY as Employer payer

    OP->>ENG: Correction run for October 2026 with lines for D, A and C
    ENG->>ENG: Classify each line and plan the returns
    ENG-->>OP: Plan - Revised for D first, then the gate, then Supplementary for A
    ENG->>LED: C arrears held as BLOCKED pending layout, due month November 2026
    OP->>EPFO: Upload the Revised October return for D
    EPFO-->>OP: Return statement
    APP->>EPFO: Approve the Revised return before any challan exists
    ENG->>ENG: Gate checks VG-E1 to VG-E6 pass
    APP->>EPFO: Instruct the October challan with any 7Q interest
    Note over ENG,EPFO: Payment initiated - no Revised October return from here, EV-037
    PAY->>EPFO: Pay the challan
    Note over OP,EPFO: 20 November - the UAN for A is seeded
    OP->>EPFO: Upload the Supplementary October return for A
    APP->>EPFO: Approve it and instruct its own challan
    PAY->>EPFO: Pay, with the interest the portal assesses
    EPFO-->>OP: Receipts
    OP->>LED: Record the Revised and the Supplementary as FILED, arrears still fenced
